    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58454" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινων-ός</span></b> , ὁ, also
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>companion, partner</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			of or in a thing, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1037
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1352
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				344
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				499
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐπιβουλῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					5.68
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					868e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀρχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.63
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.46
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τοῦ κακοῦ κ.</span>
			<i>accomplice</i> in . . , <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				730
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοσίων αὐτοῖς ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					325a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. περὶ νόμων</span>”
