				τιμῶν</span> with each other, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.6.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>partner, fellow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				284
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				333b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				239c
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ σὸς κ., οὐχ ὁ ἐμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴσοι καὶ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1133b3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινωνοὶ λιμένων</span>, of a
				<i>societas publicanorum</i> which farmed harbour-dues, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				10.267
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Syme</span>); of <i>joint-owners,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PAmh.
				2.100
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
